&INFO
   Input generated by cellify
   Geometry relaxation calculation
&END

&CPMD
   OPTIMIZE GEOMETRY XYZ
   MIRROR
   FILEPATH
         ./tmp
   CONVERGENCE GEOMETRY
         1.0e-2
   CONVERGENCE ORBITALS
         1.0e-7
   PRINT FORCES ON
   MAXSTEP
         10000
   VDW CORRECTION ON
&END

&SYSTEM
   SYMMETRY
         1
   ANGSTROM
   CELL
         10.0 1.0 1.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
   CUTOFF
         100.0
&END

&DFT
   FUNCTIONAL BLYP
&END

&VDW
   EMPIRICAL CORRECTION
   VDW PARAMETERS
   ALL DFT-D2
   END EMPIRICAL CORRECTION
&END

&ATOMS
